    "body": "﻿> *This was generated by AI during triage.*\n\nStatus correction after PR #660 ref cleanup on 2026-07-24: the real PR head is now `086d3f4f35079eaab417bfea166335e5ba9c9b9d`, with `fdfc2d4` main-readiness and the capacity fail-fast repair both included. The misleading `pr/660` branch has been deleted.\n\nThis Epic should not be auto-closed by PR #660 yet. Most child work is included, but the remaining no-fallback blockers are now tracked in reopened #669: response-chain overflow still drops work and continues, input/order prompt enqueue failure can be ignored, and Graph blackboard writes can silently return on dead/missing state.\r\n",
